WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.850
I'm going to be late! So late!

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:08.900
You shouldn't stress over things while you eat.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.610
There's also the fact that your birthday's coming up pretty soon, Lala.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.440
Oh, that's right.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.120
It's right around the corner.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.080
What salad you going to do this year?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.530
Celebrate it with Nao, of course.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.460
What?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.500
You're not going to have a birthday event in PriPara?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.790
Of course not.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:31.430
PriPara has more important things to worry about than my birthday.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:32.460
There's the phantom thief,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.260
and the phantom thief,

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.520
and can't forget the phantom thief!

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.060
Morning, Nao!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.660
Oh, hey there, Lala.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.780
Oh, birthday cakes!

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.600
Yeah.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.830
We had a cake with fruit on it last year, didn't we?

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.080
That's right.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.300
Before that we had a chocolate cake...

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.330
Yep! Yep!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.040
And before that...

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.030
Strawberry shortcake!

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:08.750
Yeah, that's right!

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.500
And before that...

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:17.190
We've celebrated our birthdays together for a long time!

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:20.900
We're so lucky to have our birthdays on the same day!

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.100
Yeah, but this year...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.930
...what kind of cake should we have?

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.310
What would you like, Nao?

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:31.820
Huh? You're still celebrating it with me?

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.460
Of course!

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:37.780
We've celebrated them together ever since kindergarten!

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:38.990
Right?

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:41.950
Yeah!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.870
It's A Birthday Promise!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.230
Capisce!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.590
Not only do I have the coords,

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:26.100
but the Princess Candidates are slowly falling into my grasp.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.060
Everything's going according to plan.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.690
Too hot...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.830
Please forgive me.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.900
I shall correct it.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.360
No, they're too hot.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.320
Why haven't they lost their motivation?!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.330
Just why?!

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.660
Huh? They won't?

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.700
That's right.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.630
I've been doing everything I can to get the system...

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:56.940
...to reprint your stolen coord tickets.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.100
I've tried reinstalling the operating system,

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:04.860
deciphering and rewriting the source code, as well as other things...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.760
But it's impossible.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.140
No way!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.490
Then, what about the parade?

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.440
Summer, Autumn, Winter, and Spring...

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.730
Once the princesses from each of the seasons have been selected,

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:22.450
the coords need to be brought together.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.800
Basically, if there's even one coord missing,

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:28.160
the parade will be cancelled.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.200
It won't happen.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.250
Hey, Mega-nii, is it possible that there might be a bug in the system-pri?

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.130
Lacking the finishing touch.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.210
Even if it looks complete, there might be something missing.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.660
No.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.160
The PriPara System is my pride and joy,

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.250
and by current standards, it's exceedingly reliable and robust.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.060
So the chances of that are extremely low.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.830
I see...

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.160
In that case, what can we do...?

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.050
Don't worry!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:57.400
I'm not giving up!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.640
Lala...

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:01.110
If we can't get new DreaTickets, we just need to get the old ones back!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.380
If we combine our powers, we can do it!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.070
Right?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.530
If we can't get new ones, get ours back.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.720
That's right!

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.210
We'll show Genius!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.560
Tension Max!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:12.910
Relax!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.410
We'll make sure to get your DreaTickets back-pri!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.960
I haven't given up either!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.590
Then, since we're not giving up...!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.980
Capisce!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.760
So everyone's here-kuma?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.300
What's with this emergency meeting-pri?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.720
And you said to keep it a secret from Lala.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.580
This is for nothing other than-usa...

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.430
...this-kuma.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.900
Lala's Birthday Event Executive Committee?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.130
That's right.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.360
Lala's birthday is coming up soon-pri.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.600
It's as I've read.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.360
We will band together,

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.450
and plan a birthday party event for Lala to show up that phantom thief.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.160
Way to go, Shion. You've got it-usa!

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:59.720
I bet Phantom Thief Genius spends his birthday alone every year anyway!

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.690
That poor narcissist!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.840
Narcissist...

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.950
There's no way.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.050
Pri.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.160
I got it!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.930
If we're doing this, let's go all out and book the Dream Theatre!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.930
If you say so, Dorothy!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.390
Agreed!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.130
It's unanimous.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.430
Might as well go all out.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.110
Pri!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.980
Then it's decided-kuma!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.660
Usa!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:25.700
Eh?!

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:28.700
Reserved for my birthday?!

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.260
Let's hurry up and record a promotional video-kuma!

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:31.960
Eh?!

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.100
W-Wait!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.730
We have to do this-kuma!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:38.070
We already got permission from Mega-nee to reserve the Dream Theatre-kuma!

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:38.870
Hurry up! Let's go!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.750
At such a big place?!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.460
W-What should I do?

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:48.600
Then let's celebrate with everyone!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.680
Everyone?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.720
I'm not the only one who was born in November.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:57.850
If we're doing this, let's celebrate with everyone in the country who was born in November!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.900
I wonder if this'll make Lala happy?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.330
To all those watching PriPara TV.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.660
Lala-san has an announcement to make.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:15.990
Hello everyone! I'm Lala from SoLaMi Smile!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.930
November is my birth month.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:23.920
As such, I've reserved the Dream Theatre to hold a special birthday event!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.130
Huh?

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.390
However, we won't be celebrating just my birthday.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:32.090
Everyone in the country who was born in November,

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.300
that's whose birthdays we'll be celebrating!

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.260
That includes Himi-chan from Pakita Prefecture.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.720
Aoi-chan from Piroshima Prefecture!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.190
Masami-chan and Kana-chan from Pokkaidou!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.900
And! And! Nao-chan from Parajuku!

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.360
I'm included?!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.230
Now then, all of you born in November,

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:56.530
gather up around me at 10 AM at the fountain square for the concert!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.100
There you have it.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.030
Those of you who were born in November,

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.750
let's get this underway!

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.210
Come in.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:07.230
I've come to submit the student council's meeting journal.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:07.880
Thanks.

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:11.400
Putting on a birthday concert?

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:14.430
How carefree.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.350
Even with the Winter GrandPrix drawing near...

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.920
We're practising our singing and dancing daily.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.270
Don't you think it's a waste?

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.700
You say that, but it's not a waste to try!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.100
Academy rule number 301 also covers this!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:33.530
"Rewards await those who put in the effort."

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.990
That is true.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.230
As the acting principal,

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:42.200
I wish for you and your friends to succeed.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.460
Is that true?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.420
Then please excuse me!

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.300
I'm November!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.260
Same here!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.260
Ponkan was born on November 3rd!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.220
Born on Culture Day-daVinci!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.130
Me too!

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.220
I'm in November!

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:02.960
I'm so happy that so many people were born in November!

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.470
I can't wait until Nao shows up!

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.460
Lala, look over there-kuma!

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:07.980
Huh?

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:09.940
What's that?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.830
They're girls from all over the country who were born in November-kuma!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.930
WHAAAAT?!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.110
Kuma!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.330
I wonder if Lala will like it?

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.170
L-Lala!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.830
Lala-chan! Lala-chan!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.330
<i>Lala...</i>

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:52.070
The event you've all been waiting for,
Lala's birthday event, is finally starting-kuma!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.070
Everyone gathered here...

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.600
...was born in November-usa?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.740
Today, those of you who were born in November...

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.160
...will take centre stage!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.960
Everyone in front of the TV, and everyone here...

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.120
Capistulations!

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.400
It's Ajimi-daVinci!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.100
To celebrate everyone's birthday,

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.710
we'll go on a journey of art around the world via sentence enders-daVinci!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.870
Let's do this-crayon!

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:17.880
Let's Gauguin!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.090
GoghGogh!

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.350
Geez, don't say Munich.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.760
Well, what will you Louvre Museum?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.690
I David-ed.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.450
Later-raphael!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.370
Do you really want to hear the story of Toriko-tori?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.840
It's rather boring, you know-tori.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:48.710
Toriko is sure you'll all decide to go home in the middle of it-tori!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.130
You can do it, Toriko-san!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:56.930
I can hear it...

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.010
I can hear it-kuma.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.700
I can hear happy birthday-usa.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.050
As expected of Ham-senpai-kuma.
As expected of Ham-senpai-usa.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.810
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:11.100
For today's celebration, Falulu will do an impersonation of Gaalulu.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.960
Falulu, don't show people that!

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:13.980
Stop!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:24.160
♪Happy birthday Lover's Cape.♪

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.570
That was New & Mew-nano!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.670
Eh-hm.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.100
W-Would you...

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.280
...write your names upon this demon's covenant?

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:36.620
She said she's a big fan and wants your autographs.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.850
Eh? You really want ours-new?

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:40.800
How touching-mew!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.750
Please welcome today's special unit!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.930
Our name is Minami Mirei and the Pool 5,

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:50.060
and our song is "Tokyo Gobi Desert"-pri!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:50.410
New!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:50.730
Mew!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.450
Kyupikon!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:51.810
Pri!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.350
Chanko!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.190
Renoir Rubens Michelangelo da Vinci!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.720
Pointless!

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.400
This is pointless!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.700
How...?!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.950
How can they pour so much energy into something so pointless?!

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.360
By the way, Hibiki-sama,

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.090
on the topic of birthdays,

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:15.330
the presents you received from your fans around the world on your last birthday...

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.770
...are still in the basement of the hotel.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.470
I get sick of it year after year.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:24.490
Please dispose of them as you see fit.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:25.860
Understood.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.210
Thank you!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.030
And congrats to all of you as well!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.150
Thank you!

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.140
Capisce!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.420
Congrats, Lala-chan!

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.220
Thank you, Eiko-chan!

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:39.780
I did my best to carve this for you, Lala-chan!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.990
T-Thanks.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.110
I-I'll treasure it.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.810
Think we'll make it before the concert?

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:47.950
Kyupikon!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.220
<i>I'm happy for you, Lala.</i>

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.160
<i>Being able to celebrate with everyone.</i>

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.900
<i>Congrats!</i>

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.850
Thanks!

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.190
Congrats!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.970
<i>Nao hasn't shown up.</i>

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.880
<i>Where could she be?</i>

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.340
I-I'll be back in a moment, I forgot something!

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:06.860
Wow...

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:10.050
<i>So many people came to the birthday event.</i>

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.560
Nao!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.770
Nao!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.290
<i>It's strange.</i>

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.230
<i>We promised...</i>

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:20.190
Nao!  Nao!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.070
<i>Maybe...</i>

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.040
These bring back memories...

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:47.150
We became friends when we were in the middle class in kindergarten.

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:49.310
We have a new friend joining us today.

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.390
Her name's Nao-chan.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.470
I'm Nao.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.640
Let's all be friends!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.810
Hey, I heard you were born in November!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.260
What day?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.400
The 20th.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.970
Wow!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.610
Lala's is also the 20th!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.820
Really?!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.800
Yeah!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.700
I'm Lala. Manaka Lala.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.780
Let's be friends!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.230
Okay!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.200
Happy birthday!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.420
My mother and I did our best to make this for you, Lala-chan!

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.350
Wow, thanks!

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:24.510
It's beautiful!

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.970
Now here's Lala's!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.460
Wow! It's Parakappa!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.150
Thanks!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.430
You said you liked him.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.140
Thanks. I'll treasure it.

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:44.110
Nao, let's celebrate our birthdays together forever, and ever, and ever!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.650
Okay! It's a promise.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.340
Capisce!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.040
Coming!

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.000
Eh?!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.410
Found you, Nao!

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.710
W-Why are you here, Lala?!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.570
Back at you; why are you here?!

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.430
I've been looking for you forever!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.660
We promised!

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:18.520
We promised to spend our birthdays together each and every year!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.810
But...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.930
You're so popular these days, Lala.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:27.470
We can't continue doing things like we always have...

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.990
So I'm celebrating my birthday by myself.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:34.580
Why did you decide that on your own?!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.010
But what about your birthday event?!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.040
You have a concert!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.750
Concerts are important,

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.370
but you're more important, Nao!

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:43.430
Lala...

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.300
Here's your present.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.260
You made it again this year!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.950
Of course!

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:57.380
Ah! Wait here!

00:15:58.860 --> 00:15:59.990
I also made something.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.140
A ribbon!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:05.000
Hold on, I'll swap them!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.580
Well? Does it look good?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.680
Yeah!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.570
Now then, let's head back to PriPara.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.030
Eh?!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.760
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.240
They want to wish you a happy birthday!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.700
And see your concert!

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.160
Ca-

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.880
Capisce!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.010
You still can't find Lala-pri?

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.370
She's gone-kuma!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.090
Where did she go?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.060
This is bad.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:32.570
It's almost time for the concert.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:33.630
You say that, but...

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.090
Hey, you're up next!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.240
By Satan, it's said to be time for the concert...

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:38.810
Yep.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.930
But it seems Lala has ran off somewhere.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.180
Oh no-nano!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.460
Mikan, can you do something?

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:45.410
Impossible-nano.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.450
A meat bun is better than a pizza bun.

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:48.850
It's an obsession-nano!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:52.440
With her overeating, Mikan's waist is getting tight-nano.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.410
Lala!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.640
All right, Lala, do your best!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.370
Capisce!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.580
I'll sing so that it reaches around the world!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.750
I'm sorry, girls!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:04.460
Lala!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.520
Ah, you're back-kuma!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:05.980
Usa.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.040
What's the big-

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.150
We're all here-pri.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.500
Welcome back.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.810
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.480
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.110
Coord Change Start!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.450
Today, everyone from around the country is taking centre stage.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:36.530
This party calls for a huge birthday cake!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.200
Lucky Surprise Birthday Coord!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.430
The party members will all be transformed into clowns!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.790
Let's decorate with party poppers and flags!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.460
Smiling Surprise Birthday Coord!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.110
Pri!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:57.300
This is the first time there's been a six person concert in the Theatre, and it's only allowed for this special birthday occasion.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.720
It's a birthday present from our PriPara idols.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.640
Exciting Surprise Birthday Coord!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:03.240
Go!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.350
Yeah!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.730
Happy birthday, Lala-chan!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:16.950
I'll be pouring all my gratitude and warm wishes into this song for all of you around the world!

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:20.320
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.530
Airy Change!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:44.160
Cyalume Airy!

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.400
Pri!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.540
Go!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.620
Nao!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.490
<i> I received them...
Congrats-pri!</i>

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:55.920
<i>Your feelings, Lala.
Congrats-pri!</i>

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.290
Congrats!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.670
<i>This has been the best birthday ever.</i>

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.650
Max congrats!

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.920
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.180
Relax!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.350
Let's Go!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:13.020
Exciting Birthday Party!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.150
Happy birthday!

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.210
Here.

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.150
Thanks!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.670
Capisce!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.390
Having cake with everyone.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.740
That's Lala for you-pri.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:47.240
Lala-chan, congrats!

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.400
We're all friends!

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:51.330
We're all idols!

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:52.800
Turn it off!

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:53.640
Right away.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:56.210
Now I understand.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.250
You're the source of it all,

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:04.740
Manaka Lala.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:07.930
She is neither a prodigy, a moron, nor does she use a sentence ender!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.890
She's my adversary!

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:18.140
Is it love... or hatred?

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:21.310
A scream rings out in the late autumn of PriPara.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.440
Detective, have you figured anything out about this case?

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:26.110
Next time, Capisce Mystery.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.020
The PriPara Serial Da Vinci Incidents.

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:30.020
DaVinci!
